==Overview==
<tabber>
|-|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Most attacks can be good for grinding.
* Requires no mastery in other fighting styles to obtain.

|'''[Z] Meteor Tackle'''
* Considerably short cooldown.
* Good mobility, especially midair.

|'''[X] Ground Breaker'''
* Highest damage out of any single melee move.
* Can be used as a stun when teaming.
* Drains plenty of dodges if instinct-tricked.
* Applies a small soft stun after the final slam, allowing the user to extend should they have a fast enough move (e.g: Sand Coffin) to do so.

|'''[C] Charged Punch'''
* Good finisher for combos.
* Good reversal.
* High damage and AoE if held.
* Can chain directly into Ground Breaker if aimed downwards.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Extremely hard to obtain for most players.
* Slow M1 speed.
* Incredibly low range.
* Mostly instinct-trickable

|'''[Z] Meteor Tackle'''
* Can be dodged with [[Instinct]].
* Low damage.

|'''[X] Ground Breaker'''
* Hard to hit.
* Small AoE.
* Enemy's landing point is random, requiring the user to actively watch where the opponent lands to utilize in a combo.
* Won't pin enemies down if Instinct-tricked up high, midair.
* Can be instinct-tricked.
* Very high endlag if hit, which can be a great issue when fighting multiple enemies.
* Endlag extends 0.2 seconds after the stun has ended, making it nearly useless against a well timed [[Flash Step]].

|'''[C] Charged Punch'''
* Breaks Instinct only at closest range.
* High knockback.
* Low range.
* Long cooldown.
* Long charge time.
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* This is the only improved version of a fighting style without a [[Mastery|mastery]] requirement from its previous version, which is Combat.
* The player can acquire this fighting style at any level. However, the minimum [[Level]] a user can have to get this fighting style is 196, due to the levels given by completing all of the Island Secrets.
* Using [X] Ground Breaker in longer lasting AoE moves can hit during the stun breaking Instinct, which allows it to become true.
** Only moves that break Instinct and have a long duration can do this. For example [[Skull Guitar]] [X] or [[Venom]] [C].

